# Virtual environment
# No trailing slash: a SYMLINK to a venv elsewhere is not a directory, and
# `.pdfmm-venv/` does not match one. One was committed that way -- a link to
# a path in another user's home, broken for everyone who clones.
work/
# The hidden names this subtree used before T-0113. Kept so a stale copy
# on someone's machine does not suddenly show up as untracked.
.pdfmm-venv
.pdfmm-build
.pdfmm-venv/
.pdfmm-build/

